```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>ComplainEase</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

    <h1>ComplainEase</h1>
    <h3>Online Complaint Management System</h3>

    <input type="text" id="name" placeholder="Enter your name">
    <input type="text" id="category" placeholder="Complaint category">
    <textarea id="complaint" placeholder="Enter your complaint"></textarea>

    <button id="submitBtn">Submit Complaint</button>

    <h3>Complaint History</h3>
    <div id="result"></div>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
```